🛠️ UC Suite Pro: Technical Specifications

Project Name: Ultimate Crypto Suite (Professional Edition)

Developer: Emily Edward

Architecture: Multi-Tier Distributed System (Java-Python-Node.js)
1. Core Security Architecture

Mfumo huu hautegemei njia moja tu ya ulinzi; unatumia tabaka tatu (3) za usalama:

    Client-Side Encryption (Java): Data zote zinafanyiwa encryption kwenye kifaa cha mtumiaji kabla ya kusafirishwa. Hii inazuia mashambulizi ya Man-in-the-Middle (MITM).

    Zero-Knowledge Storage: Database (MongoDB Atlas) inapokea Ciphertext pekee. Hata kama server itadukuliwa, hakuna data inayosomeka itakayopatikana.

    Hardware-ID (HWID) Binding: Leseni ya software inafungwa kwenye kifaa kimoja maalum, kuzuia Software Piracy na matumizi yasiyo na idhini.

2. Cryptographic Standards

    Algorithm: AES-256 (Advanced Encryption Standard) katika GCM Mode (Galois/Counter Mode).

    Security Benefit: GCM inatoa sio tu siri (Confidentiality), bali pia uhakiki wa data (Authenticity), kuhakikisha data haijabadilishwa njiani.

    Key Management: Master Keys hazihifadhiwi kwenye cloud; zinabaki kwenye kumbukumbu ya muda ya mtumiaji (RAM) pekee wakati wa session.

3. Forensic & Audit Capabilities

Hapa ndipo UC Suite Pro inatofautiana na apps za kawaida za password:

    Cryptographic Audit Logs: Kila muamala unazalisha Authenticity Stamp (SHA-256 Hash).

    Non-Repudiation: Ripoti inayozalishwa (Audit PDF) haiwezi kubadilishwa bila Stamp hiyo kuharibika, jambo ambalo ni muhimu kwa ushahidi wa kisheria.

    Automated Export: Uwezo wa kutoa ripoti za kiuchunguzi moja kwa moja kwenda kwenye Desktop kwa ajili ya ukaguzi wa usalama.

4. Technology Stack (The "Global" Engine)
Layer	Technology	Role
Frontend	Java (JavaFX & Maven)	User Interface & Local AES Logic
Auth API	Python (FastAPI & Uvicorn)	License Verification & HWID Lock
Cloud API	Node.js (Express)	Secure Data Bridge to Cloud
Database	MongoDB Atlas	Global Encrypted Persistence